=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Maat} at (H-5) in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} on each job. He will ask for a Testimony for each job and ask you to meet him at a specific BC area to fight.
* Defeat {p:Maat} with:
** {p:Bard}
** {p:Beastmaster}
** {p:Black Mage}
** {p:Dark Knight}
** {p:Dragoon}
** {p:Monk}
** {p:Ninja}
** {p:Paladin}
** {p:Ranger}
** {p:Red Mage}
** {p:Samurai}
** {p:Summoner}
** {p:Thief}
** {p:Warrior}
** {p:White Mage}

* These fights are similar to the {q:Shattering Stars|Shattering Stars|Shattering Stars} fight, but there are no level caps.
** The level required to fight {p:Maat} is at least level 66.
* To check which jobs that you have beaten {p:Maat} with, enter {z:Feretory} and talk to {n:Teyrnon}. Instincts associated with jobs on which you have defeated {p:Maat} will cost 5,000 {p:Infamy} instead of 10,000. However, if you have already bought an {p:instinct|Instinct} at 10,000, it will not be listed again.
* Upon defeating {p:Maat} for the last time, speak with him to receive the cutscene and your new {i:Maat's Cap|Maat's Cap|15194}.

